00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:13.984
- Paano ka bababa? [bulalas]
- Huwag kang mag-alala, makikita kita doon!

219
00:12:14.985 --> 00:12:16.944
[Jae-yoon] Nakuha mo ito! Halika na!

220
00:12:16.945 --> 00:12:19.238
[lahat ng nagyaya]

221
00:12:19.239 --> 00:12:21.324
[tawa]

222
00:12:25.162 --> 00:12:26.954
- Isa pa ang natitira!
- Sarhento Kim!

223
00:12:26.955 --> 00:12:28.539
Bilisan mo! Hindi naman ganoon kalala!

224
00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.374
Maghintay ka. kanino ito?

225
00:12:30.375 --> 00:12:33.128
- Ito-- Ito-- Ito ay kay Sergeant Kim.
- Huh? Huh?

226
00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:37.883
[Gye-young] Sarhento Kim.

227
00:12:41.761 --> 00:12:42.762
Sarhento Kim?

228
00:12:43.555 --> 00:12:46.682
- Paano ka bumababa?
- [Gye-young] Huli ka na, dali!

229
00:12:46.683 --> 00:12:48.101
[Kyung-sik] Anong ginagawa mo?

230
00:12:50.937 --> 00:12:52.731
- Tayo na! Hell to the yeah!
- Hey, hey. Hoy!

231
00:12:53.523 --> 00:12:54.523
Sandali lang.

232
00:12:54.524 --> 00:12:56.359
Oh aking diyos, kung ano ang isang idiot.

233
00:12:57.444 --> 00:12:58.278
[bumuntong hininga]

234
00:13:06.953 --> 00:13:08.205
Sa tingin ko tapos na para sa akin.

235
00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:09.789
- Huh? ano?
- Huh?

236
00:13:10.207 --> 00:13:11.041
ano?

237
00:13:12.459 --> 00:13:13.293
sa tingin ko...

238
00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:16.963
Kailangang magpatuloy kayo.

239
00:13:17.714 --> 00:13:18.715
<i>Ngunit wala ako.</i>

240
00:13:22.093 --> 00:13:22.928
[bumuntong hininga]

241
00:13:25.597 --> 00:13:27.349
- [Jae-yoon] Sarhento Kim!
- [In-ho] Teka!

242
00:13:28.266 --> 00:13:31.101
Hoy, Sergeant Kim!
Bumaba ka na lang dito. Oo?

243
00:13:31.102 --> 00:13:32.436
May aalamin tayo.

244
00:13:32.437 --> 00:13:34.563
- Hoy, alak!
- [In-ho] Oh. Alak...

245
00:13:34.564 --> 00:13:36.607
[Arron] Uminom ka ng booze
at magiging maayos ka!

246
00:13:36.608 --> 00:13:39.026
Alak lang ang dahilan kung bakit ako tao pa.

247
00:13:39.027 --> 00:13:41.570
- Totoo naman...
- [Arron] Sabay nating aayusin!

248
00:13:41.571 --> 00:13:43.532
- [beeps]
- [Young-man] <i>Booze?</i>

249
00:13:44.282 --> 00:13:45.741
<i>Iyan ay walang kahulugan.</i>

250
00:13:45.742 --> 00:13:47.285
Ay, teka. Maghintay ka!

251
00:13:48.119 --> 00:13:50.704
Actually Arron Park
patuloy lang sa pag-inom ng alak

252
00:13:50.705 --> 00:13:52.790
at hindi pa sya nag muta!

253
00:13:52.791 --> 00:13:55.043
Sarhento, uminom ng alak! Oo?

254
00:13:56.002 --> 00:13:57.586
- [beeps]
- [Young-man] <i>Alam mo,</i>

255
00:13:57.587 --> 00:14:01.591
[Tumawa] <i>parang baliw
Naniniwala ako sa iyo.</i>

256
00:14:02.884 --> 00:14:07.931
<i>Pero pakiramdam ko</i> [sighs]
<i>Medyo huli na para sa akin.</i>

257
00:14:12.185 --> 00:14:13.019
<i>Siguraduhin...</i>

258
00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.689
<i>Lahat ay nakaligtas.</i>

259
00:14:18.733 --> 00:14:23.405
<i>Ito na ang huling utos ko bilang pag-arte
kumander ng pulutong.</i>

260
00:14:24.239 --> 00:14:26.365
- Hoy...
- Hindi! Teka, teka!

261
00:14:26.366 --> 00:14:28.200
Sergeant Kim! Maghintay, mangyaring!

262
00:14:28.201 --> 00:14:29.119
[beep]

263
00:14:39.879 --> 00:14:40.714
binata...

264
00:14:42.757 --> 00:14:43.592
[bumuntong hininga]

265
00:14:47.679 --> 00:14:48.972
[babae] Halika. Ito ay ligtas.

266
00:14:52.434 --> 00:14:54.060
Mag-ingat ka. Bantayan mo ang iyong hakbang.

267
00:14:56.688 --> 00:14:57.522
Manahimik ka!

268
00:15:07.991 --> 00:15:08.825
Sa ganitong paraan.

269
00:15:14.414 --> 00:15:15.624
Nandito na! Magmadali!

270
00:15:20.754 --> 00:15:21.921
[Napabuntong hininga si Young-joo]

271
00:15:24.466 --> 00:15:27.302
Mga zombie ba ito o mga tao?

272
00:15:27.844 --> 00:15:31.222
[babae] Dahil sa dami ng dugo
sa sahig, siguradong tao.

273
00:15:31.931 --> 00:15:34.225
Pinatay sila
ng mga hamak na humabol sayo.

274
00:15:38.146 --> 00:15:39.272
Nakakadurog ng puso.

275
00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.695
- Ayos ka lang ba?
- Ano?

276
00:15:46.696 --> 00:15:49.074
Ay... hindi ako sigurado.

277
00:15:54.496 --> 00:15:55.330
Sumunod ka sa akin.

278
00:16:00.752 --> 00:16:02.712
Huwag kang mag-alala. Ligtas dito, pangako.

279
00:16:07.008 --> 00:16:09.135
Maghihintay kami dito, para makapagpahinga ka na

280
00:16:10.303 --> 00:16:11.554
at tumungo sa istasyon.

281
00:16:13.765 --> 00:16:16.141
- Any luck, Ra In-ho?
- [In-ho] Nakatingin pa rin sir!

282
00:16:16.142 --> 00:16:17.893
[Soo-jeong] Oh, tara na! [ungol]

283
00:16:17.894 --> 00:16:19.437
[In-ho] Sus! Wala dito.

284
00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.233
[bumuntong hininga, hingal]

285
00:16:25.944 --> 00:16:26.778
Huh?

286
00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:34.911
[beeps]

287
00:16:36.454 --> 00:16:38.706
