291
00:16:47.507 --> 00:16:49.175
- Tara na. Simulan mo na, bilisan mo.
- Teka!

292
00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:52.512
Kyung-sik. Wala pa siya dito.

293
00:16:54.889 --> 00:16:55.724
Oh...

294
00:16:57.016 --> 00:16:58.475
Siya lang...

295
00:16:58.476 --> 00:17:00.061
Tumakbo mag-isa sa kung saan.

296
00:17:01.563 --> 00:17:03.606
At ngayon mo lang sinabi sa amin ang tungkol dito?

297
00:17:05.066 --> 00:17:07.819
[sighs] Shit.

298
00:17:11.573 --> 00:17:14.992
Tara na. Magmaneho papuntang Suseo Station.

299
00:17:14.993 --> 00:17:16.035
Oo, tayo na.

300
00:17:34.137 --> 00:17:36.139
[nakanguso]

301
00:17:38.099 --> 00:17:40.435
[Tunog ng mga alarm ng sasakyan]

302
00:17:47.066 --> 00:17:47.901
[kulog]

303
00:17:49.402 --> 00:17:51.404
[nakanguso]

304
00:18:09.088 --> 00:18:10.089
[bumuntong hininga]

305
00:18:16.429 --> 00:18:17.263
[bumuntong hininga]

306
00:18:25.605 --> 00:18:26.439
