316
00:18:49.504 --> 00:18:51.547
Pribadong Hwang Kyung-sik!

317
00:18:51.548 --> 00:18:54.216
Ito ang anak ko ngayon.
Walang nanggugulo sa kanya.

318
00:18:54.217 --> 00:18:55.802
- Ah-huh!
- Okay, kung gayon.

319
00:18:56.344 --> 00:18:57.345
Ngayon ay pamilya na kami.

320
00:18:57.846 --> 00:18:59.304
Pribadong Hwang Kyung-sik!

321
00:18:59.305 --> 00:19:00.431
Nakuha ko, tama!

322
00:19:08.481 --> 00:19:11.359
Pribadong Hwang Kyung-sik.
Salamat sa pagkain, sir!

323
00:19:12.318 --> 00:19:13.278
