325
00:19:15.864 --> 00:19:17.115
Sige, tapos na ako.

326
00:19:18.199 --> 00:19:19.200
Oo, dito.

327
00:19:19.951 --> 00:19:22.661
- Pribadong Hwang Kyung-Sik.
- Perfect sila sir.

328
00:19:22.662 --> 00:19:24.289
Ah, hindi na kailangang magpasalamat.

329
00:19:25.081 --> 00:19:28.209
Kailangang tiyakin ng isang ama ang kanyang anak
