337
00:19:44.517 --> 00:19:46.435
Kunin mo na lang.

338
00:19:46.436 --> 00:19:48.897
- Pagod na ang braso ko. Ikaw maliit na tae.
- Hindi ko kaya, ginoo.

339
00:19:51.232 --> 00:19:52.066
