sa Express Bus Terminal.

361
00:22:03.072 --> 00:22:04.614
Ligtas ako, huwag mag-alala!

362
00:22:04.615 --> 00:22:07.034
[Mom ni Young-joo] <i>Bakit hindi mo ginawa
