386
00:23:12.391 --> 00:23:15.103
Gusto kong makasigurado
Hindi ko nakakalimutan ang iyong pangalan.

387
00:23:15.353 --> 00:23:16.562
SEOUL METRO
PARK EUN-CHAE

388
00:23:17.522 --> 00:23:18.356
Oo.

389
00:23:19.273 --> 00:23:20.108
